# ---- 9. Afterwards ----------------------------------------------------------
# Write a FINDINGS.md at the run root first -- what the run was, what it was
# measured against, the numbers, what they mean -- generated from the artifacts
# rather than transcribed. Then archive, with a description: a bare output_NNN
# means nothing was learned there, and that is the signal you want in six
# months when deciding what to delete.

python3 -m tools.audit_report_safety output/FINDINGS.md
./clean "$RUN_NAME"      # name it. A bare output_NNN means nothing was learned
